    "text": "COMPLIANCE:\nScene ID: SC_001_008\nAllowed events: Artie acquires the cursed Participation Trophy after vaporizing a slime.\nForbidden milestones: None\nCurrent arm-side / inventory facts: Leather Wallet (stowed, pocket_right), Employee ID Badge (equipped, neck_lanyard)\n\nAPPEARANCE_CHECK:\n- CHAR_ARTIE: average height, skinny_fat build, messy brown hair, brown eyes, pale skin.\n- CHAR_FIZZ: tiny ethereal build, glowing neon_pink hair, digital_blue eyes, translucent skin.\n\nPROSE:\nArtie cautiously approached the golden loot drop left in the crater of the vaporized slime. The air still smelled heavily of ozone and whatever chemical compound made up a gelatinous monster. At the center of the scorched earth, a small, glowing sphere hovered just inches above the dirt, pulsing with an inviting, warm light.\n\n\"Ooh, shiny!\" Fizz did a mid-air loop, her neon-pink glowing hair trailing like a comet's tail. \"That's a high-tier drop aura! You must have triggered an overkill multiplier when you did ninety-nine thousand damage to a level one mob. Touch it! Touch it!\"\n\nArtie hesitated, glancing down at his hands. He was still reeling from the fact that a single, panicked kick had practically erased a biological entity from existence. But the glowing orb was mesmerizing. It looked like a reward. He reached out, his fingers brushing the radiant surface. \n\nThe golden light shattered like glass, dissolving into the air to reveal the item hidden within. It dropped into his waiting right hand with a pathetic, hollow clack.\n\nArtie stared at it. It was a cheap, wooden Participation Trophy, complete with a peeling, gold-painted plastic star on top and a tattered red ribbon tied around the base.\n\n[Item Looted: Participation Trophy]\n\n\"A trophy?\" Artie muttered, turning the pathetic object over in his right hand. \"I vaporized a monster with the power of a tactical nuke, and the system gives me a hunk of plastic?\"\n\n\"Wait, let me scan it,\" Fizz said, floating closer, her blue pixel eyes narrowing. \"Sometimes joke items have hidden stats\u2014oh. Oh no.\"\n\nBefore Artie could ask what she meant, the Participation Trophy vanished from his right hand. \n\nA sharp weight suddenly dragged at the left side of his chest. Artie looked down. The Participation Trophy was now securely fastened to the lapel of his cheap office suit, pinning the fabric together. \n\n[Equip Notification: Participation Trophy has automatically equipped!]\n\n\"Hey, what the\u2014\" Artie grabbed the wooden base with his left hand and pulled. It didn't budge. He pulled harder, planting his feet and yanking with both hands. The fabric of his suit jacket stretched, but the Participation Trophy remained perfectly, immovably anchored to his chest.\n\n[Item Stats: Participation Trophy]\n[Rarity: Trash]\n[Modifiers: +0 All Stats. At least you tried.]\n\n\"Get it off,\" Artie grunted, straining against the item. \"Fizz, how do I unequip this?\"\n\nThe fairy winced, her translucent form shrinking back slightly. \"You... kind of can't. It's a binding drop.\"\n\nA pulsing red system box materialized directly in front of Artie's face, flashing with an aggressive warning chime.\n\n[Cursed Status: Participation Trophy cannot be unequipped, dropped, or sold. You are bound to your mediocrity.]\n\nArtie released the Participation Trophy, his shoulders slumping. He had one hit point, a glitch that made him a walking glass cannon, and now he was permanently branded with an award for showing up. \"This,\" he sighed, the plastic star catching the sunlight, \"is going to be a very long afterlife.\"\n\nSTATE_PATCH:\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"world_updates\": {\n    \"cast_present\": [\n      \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n      \"CHAR_FIZZ\"\n    ],\n    \"location\": \"LOC_TUTORIAL_FOREST\",\n    \"open_threads\": [\n      \"THREAD_GLITCH\",\n      \"THREAD_CURSED_LOOT\"\n    ],\n    \"recent_facts\": [\n      \"Artie looted a golden drop from the vaporized slime.\",\n      \"The drop contained the cursed Participation Trophy, which permanently equipped itself to Artie's lapel.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"summary_update\": {\n    \"last_scene\": [\n      \"Artie looted the golden drop left by the vaporized slime.\",\n      \"The item revealed itself as a cheap Participation Trophy.\",\n      \"The trophy permanently equipped itself to Artie's lapel as a cursed item.\"\n    ],\n    \"key_events\": [\n      \"Artie looted the golden drop left by the vaporized slime.\",\n      \"The item revealed itself as a cheap Participation Trophy.\",\n      \"The trophy permanently equipped itself to Artie's lapel as a cursed item.\"\n    ],\n    \"must_stay_true\": [\n      \"inventory: CHAR_ARTIE -> Leather Wallet (status=stowed, container=pocket_right)\",\n      \"inventory: CHAR_ARTIE -> Employee ID Badge (status=equipped, container=neck_lanyard)\",\n      \"container: pocket_right (owner=CHAR_ARTIE, contents=[ITEM_wallet])\",\n      \"container: neck_lanyard (owner=CHAR_ARTIE, contents=[ITEM_employee_id])\",\n      \"Artie has 1/1 HP, 10/10 Stamina, and a 100% Critical Hit Rate.\",\n      \"Artie is physically present in the Tutorial Forest.\",\n      \"Artie has 5 XP.\",\n      \"inventory: CHAR_ARTIE -> Participation Trophy (status=equipped, container=lapel)\",\n      \"container: lapel (owner=CHAR_ARTIE, contents=[ITEM_participation_trophy])\"\n    ],\n    \"chapter_so_far_add\": [\n      \"Artie looted the golden drop left by the vaporized slime.\",\n      \"The item revealed itself as a cheap Participation Trophy.\",\n      \"The trophy permanently equipped itself to Artie's lapel as a cursed item.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"character_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"character_id\": \"CHAR_ARTIE\",\n      \"chapter\": 1,\n      \"scene\": 8,\n      \"inventory\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": \"ITEM_wallet\",\n          \"container\": \"pocket_right\",\n          \"status\": \"stowed\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": \"ITEM_empl